<view class="container nav-safe objects-page"><view class="eyebrow">IMPACT AREAS · 01 HOUR</view><view class="title page-title">区域影响</view><view class="subtitle">把回波对象转换成可执行的区域判断，帮助调度人员决定先看哪里。</view><view class="card object-map"><view class="map-grid"></view><view class="map-radar radar-main"></view><view class="map-zone zone-red"></view><view class="map-zone zone-orange"></view><view class="map-zone zone-blue"></view><text class="map-label label-red">东湖高新区 83%</text><text class="map-label label-orange">天河机场 68%</text><text class="map-label label-blue">汉口核心区 42%</text></view><view class="section-title section-gap">区域列表</view><view class="region-tabs"><block wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="id"><view class="region-tab {{selected.id === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectRegion"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.probability}}%</text></view></block></view><view class="card detail-card"><view class="row"><view><view class="caption">影响判断</view><view class="detail-title">{{selected.name}}</view></view><text class="tag {{selected.color === 'red' ? 'tag-red' : selected.color === 'orange' ? 'tag-orange' : 'tag-blue'}}">{{selected.level}}</text></view><view class="impact-number">{{selected.probability}}<text>%</text></view><text class="impact-time">{{selected.time}} 进入强回波可能影响窗口</text><view class="divider"></view><view class="reason-title">为什么这样判断</view><view class="reason-line"><view class="reason-dot red"></view><text>{{selected.reason}}</text></view><view class="reason-line"><view class="reason-dot orange"></view><text>主回波最大 VIL 51.4，过去 10 分钟仍在增强</text></view><view class="reason-line"><view class="reason-dot blue"></view><text>对象质心向东南移动，历史 8 帧连续有效</text></view></view><view class="section-title section-gap">相关回波对象</view><view class="object-list"><block wx:for="{{objects}}" wx:key="id"><view class="object-row card"><view class="object-swatch {{item.kind === '增强' ? 'hot' : item.kind === '新生' ? 'new' : 'weak'}}"></view><view class="object-copy"><text class="object-name">{{item.label}}</text><text class="caption">{{item.kind}} · VIL {{item.maxVil}} · {{item.movement}}</text></view><text class="object-confidence">{{item.confidence}}%</text></view></block></view><button class="ghost-btn evidence-btn" bindtap="goEvidence">查看证据链</button></view>
